\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b0\f1\fs22 Rab\cell Well, now... This place looks a mite familiar...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, it's these funny wee buildings... We've seen them before...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Yes, there's no mistaking it. It looks just like the floating island where we met the Watcher, doesn't it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Let's go and take a closer look. Who knows\emdash we might find something interesting...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell This painting...it's fascinating... It really...draws you in, doesn't it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It reminds me of something... Ah, of course! I've been reading a book they say was written by the Watchers of late. Let me see if I can find the right part...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell\lquote SPIRITS OF LOST TIME. BEINGS BORN FROM THE LAND. BEINGS WHO CONTROL TIME.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell\lquote Spirits of Lost Time\rquote ? Could they be these figures in the painting?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell According to the book, they guard a sacred light that controls the flow of time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell And when that light burns bright enough, even those who are lost to eternity can be restored...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Restored how, exactly? You mean like...brought back to life?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Wait! If that was true, then maybe\emdash well just maybe...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Think about it! We lost someone to eternity, didn't we? Someone we'd love to see again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Veronica!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Do you really think we could...bring her back?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Well? What else does it say about this light?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell\lquote LIGHT LIVES IN TOWER'S HEART. SACRED TOWER. TOWER OF LOST TIME.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell\lquote WATCHERS GUARD WHEEL OF TIME. KEY TO TOWER. KEY TO TIME.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell\lquote KEY BRINGS SPIRITS. SETS WHEELS IN MOTION.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell So if we had the Wheel of Time, we might... We might really be able to...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell What have we got to lose? If there's even a chance, we have to try, right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Erik's right! No matter how unlikely it is, if it might be our chance to see her again, we simply have to try!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell But the Watchers are all gone, right? So how do we find this Wheel thingy?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell This was once one of their islands, wasn't it? And I'd say that hole in the wall up there was pretty wheel-like...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I reckon we could do worse than start our search right here, ye know.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell There's a way through up there. Let's go poke around some more, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> acquires the Wheel of Time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You found the Wheel of Time! Honey, you are just too good at this!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So if I understood that book correctly, the Wheel will bring the Spirits of Lost Time to the tower they mentioned.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell But where might this tower be found? No likely candidates spring to mind...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell What's the matter, darling?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell You got an idea where the place we're looking for might be?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I thought of something\emdash there's an old tower north of Yggdrasil I always wondered about.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Unless anyone's got any better ideas, what say we climb aboard our friendly whale and see what we can see up there?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Looks like we found the right tower. I wonder if these Spirits of Lost Time are here already...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Come on, laddie. Let's head on in and see what we can see.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am the Timekeeper... The flow of time... Of destiny... I watch over them... Guide them...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell But what ARE you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell I am just what I say I am... And that is all I am...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I... I hope you don't mind us intruding, but...we heard there might be a rather special light here in the tower that can... Well, that can...bring people back...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell We've lost someone very special you see, and...well, we were hoping you might be able to help us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell You speak of Time's Sphere...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell If you were to harness its power, that which you seek might be attained...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell But to lose time is to lose much... The path you propose to follow is not one to be trodden lightly...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell To lose time? What do you mean?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Time's Sphere is the crystallisation of all that has taken place in Erdrea since memory began... Each moment gathered by the Spirits of Lost Time... Savoured... Remembered...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell To take a sword to the Sphere would be to erase those moments... To return to the time of the last intact memory...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell If your companion is to be restored to you...time itself must be destroyed...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell As I say... To lose time is to lose much...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell So in order to save Veronica, we would need to...turn back time...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I think I'm beginning to get the picture...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell We'd need to go back to... Aye...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell We'd need to go back to before Yggdrasil fell! That way, we could stop Mordegon before it was too late!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell That wouldnae just save Veronica\emdash it would save the whole of Erdrea! Think of all the pain and suffering we could prevent!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell It is possible... All is possible...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell It may be that returning to that particular fork in the flow of time brings all that you wish and more...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Then it must be done! I would gladly give up all that has happened since that day for the chance to change it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Alas, to lose time is to lose much... Only one of you may return to that place...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell The Sphere can be broken but once... By a single hand... A hand possessed of a singular power...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell In this world only one such power exists...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell That of the Luminary...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell I see you... I know you... I knew you the moment you appeared...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Only you can break the Sphere... And only with the Sword of Light...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell When it is broken... When the memories are shattered... You will return to the past... And there you will stay...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell You mean he'll have to live it all again? He can't come back here...to us?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell To lose time is to lose much... This world... This reality... These will be lost to you... And that is not all...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell The outcome of the Sphere's shattering is impossible to foresee...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell You may be lost forever... Trapped in a corner of time... A half-faded memory...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell (gasp) That's awful...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Your present... Your companions... Your life, even... All these may be lost to you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Knowing this, are you willing to risk all for the sake of your departed friend...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Only you can decide... I will await you before the Sphere...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I'm sorry, but you simply can't do this! We won't let you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Okay, okay. You win...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell We know you well enough by now not to try and talk you out of this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell But you'd better not mess this up! You go back there and you save her, you hear? Save us all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Do what you have to do. We won't stand in your way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell The decision is made... Then you must know all that I know...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell To lose time will be to lose much... But some semblance of your present self will remain...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Your memories... The record of your adventures thus far...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Your knowledge of battle, and all that you have learned...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell And last of all...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell The containers that surround the altar... These are the Time Capsules...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell These sacred vessels are immune to the flow of time...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell When you shatter the Sphere, all that you possess will be placed within them...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Thus may the items you require journey with you to the past...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Alas, there is one item that will not survive the journey: the Sword of Light...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell But you should retain possession of its twin, the Sword of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell This will surely prove to be a more than worthy weapon for the time being.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
\pard\intbl The Timekeeper\cell Now you know all that I know... All else is...unknowable... When you are ready, join me by the Sphere...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1513\cellx10333 
